OL,3,GNEWSAThousands including Geraint the
OL,4,Adog cheer on Tour of Britain cyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first stage of the 2026 Tour of
OL,7,FBritain men's cycling race started in
OL,8,FLincolnshire earlier.
OL,10,FRiders set off from Lincoln and raced
OL,11,Fthrough towns and villages including
OL,12,FMarket Rasen, Rothwell, Caistor,
OL,13,FWaddingham and Burton before returning
OL,14,Fto the city centre.
OL,16,FThey covered a total of about 113.4
OL,17,Fmiles (182.5km) with an elevation of
OL,18,F4,570ft (1,393m).
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
