OL,3,GNEWSAThousands including Geraint the
OL,4,Adog cheer on Tour of Britain cyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Lincolnshire County
OL,7,FCouncil, about 8,000 spectators turned
OL,8,Fout to cheer the competitors in
OL,9,FLincoln, with mini events and
OL,10,Fcelebrations held along the route.
